[32m+[m[32m//[m
[32m+[m[32m// Checks that the kernel part of virtual address space[m
[32m+[m[32m// has been set up roughly correctly (by mem_init()).[m
[32m+[m[32m//[m
[32m+[m[32m// This function doesn't test every corner case,[m
[32m+[m[32m// but it is a pretty good sanity check.[m
[32m+[m[32m//[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mstatic void[m
